  "description": "Operating Area: Greek Islands\n\nEstia Poseidon, built by Falcon Yachts accommodates up to ten guests in a versatile four-cabin configuration, including a Master Suite, a VIP cabin, and two Twin cabins with Pullman berths, suitable for family groups or couples. She boasts clean, comfortable interiors and a well-balanced layout across all decks, featuring plenty of outdoor dining areas and shaded lounging spaces. She offers smooth travel between destinations with a cruising speed of 20 knots and is ideal for guests who appreciate classic comfort and the calm rhythm of life on the water.",
